  "description": "TheBlack Lava 3 – the high-end touring bike on a whole new level. A lightweight aluminium frame with sanded and filled weld seams in a carbon look: Sporty, elegant and well thought-out down to the last detail. The asymmetric performance fork made from carbon weighs less than 500g and even offers front roller mounts. A high-quality Rohloff Speedhub 14-speed hub gear and the low-noise Gates Carbon Drive belt ensure maximum efficiency with low maintenance. Successful detailed solutions such as internally routed cables, design-integrated mudguards and a very sturdy pannier rack give the Black Lava 3 an unmistakable look and a high level of everyday practicality. Powerful front and rear lights ensure maximum visibility in traffic at any time of day.” ¹ approx. 14.8 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for frame colour Obsidian Black, size 19”, without pedals",
